<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    raphael (Snapdragon 855 / SM8150) thermal/performance ladder - balanced.
    Target device: Xiaomi Redmi K20 Pro (raphael)

    CPU topology:
      policy0 : CPU0-3 (Little / Kryo 485 Silver, A55-based)
      policy4 : CPU4-6 (Big    / Kryo 485 Gold,   A76-based)
      policy7 : CPU7   (Prime  / Kryo 485 Prime,  A76-based)

    All CPU/GPU frequencies are exact OPPs read from a Raphael device
